OL,3,GNEWSACompulsory microchipping planned
OL,4,Afor cats and dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrochipping could become compulsory
OL,7,Ffor all cats and dogs kept in Jersey
OL,8,Funder plans out for consultation.
OL,10,FAll dogs and cats would have their
OL,11,Fdetails recorded on a database under
OL,12,Fproposals set out in the draft Animal
OL,13,FWelfare Order, politicians said.
OL,15,FMinisters said microchipping provided a
OL,16,Fpermanent and reliable way of
OL,17,Fidentifying pets and linking them to
OL,18,Ftheir keepers.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
