OL,3,GNEWSACompulsory microchipping planned
OL,4,Afor cats and dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey added the move aimed to support
OL,7,Fresponsible pet ownership, improve
OL,8,Fanimal welfare and increase the chances
OL,9,Fof lost pets being reunited with their
OL,10,Fowners more quickly.
